Third-party notices and design notes

This package deliberately links against **no** GPL code. It re-implements the
small Impact Pack *protocols* it needs (duck typing on method names), which
keeps this package MIT:

  - comfyui-impact-pack (GPL-3.0): only the method-name contract is used --
    `control_net_wrapper.apply(positive, negative, image, mask=None, use_acn=False)`
    and `control_net_wrapper.doit_ipadapter(model)`. No code is copied or imported.

Optional runtime dependencies (NOT bundled, NOT in `dependencies`):

  - ComfyUI-Anima-LLLite (Apache-2.0): loaded at runtime by file path, used as a
    library to patch a MODEL with LLLite weights.
  - comfyui-sam2 (Apache-2.0 for its GroundingDINO/ SAM2 parts): its model
    architecture may be imported at runtime when present (read-only).
  - comfyui-inspire-pack (GPL-3.0): only passed through as an opaque
    `SEGS_PREPROCESSOR` object; never imported.

If LLLite weights or the Anima model are third-party assets, their own licenses
(non-commercial for Anima models) apply to those assets, not to this code.
